      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Descriptions",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s004-descriptions.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "## Descriptions\n\nFree-form descriptions (as described above for `Feature`) can also be placed underneath\n`Example`/`Scenario`, `Background`, `Scenario Outline` and `Rule`.\n\nYou can write anything you like, as long as no line starts with a keyword.\n\nDescriptions can be in the form of Markdown - formatters including the official HTML formatter support this.",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
